OL,3,AFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,4,Aand northern England disrupted by air
OL,5,Atraffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FEasyJet - one of the airlines affected
OL,8,Ftoday - says this "once again calls
OL,9,Finto questions the resilience of Nats'
OL,10,Fsystems"
OL,12,FLewis Fraser, from Inverness, is stuck
OL,13,Fon the runway at Glasgow Airport. "We
OL,14,Fboarded the flight as normal but were
OL,15,Fimmediately told we were delayed...
OL,16,FSome passengers have left the plane,"
OL,17,Fhe tells us
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
